I hope it looks
better from there.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:13.000
So first, I add an application
group, and I give it a name.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:16.633
NAVEEN CHAND: Is it good
and visible from outside?

00:13:16.633 --> 00:13:19.050
BRENO DE MEDEIROS: And I will
